message: "If you use Promptolution in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: Promptolution
abstract: >-
  A unified, modular framework for prompt optimization, providing a zoo of prompt
  optimization algorithms, a common LLM backend for API, local and vLLM models, and
  config-driven experiment grids for reproducible research.
